/reports/research_log/major_revision_v3/phase2c_subgroup_proxy_use/** -text whitespace=-trailing-space
/reports/research_log/major_revision_v3/phase3a_hrdataset_sensitivity/** -text whitespace=-trailing-space
/reports/research_log/major_revision_v3/phase3b_data_quality/** -text whitespace=-trailing-space
/reports/research_log/major_revision_v3/phase4a_literature/** -text whitespace=-trailing-space
